      <title>特斯拉MultiPass狂飙突进欧洲：非特斯拉充电桩接入，万亿市场新机遇？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251106-%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89multipass%E7%8B%82%E9%A3%99%E7%AA%81%E8%BF%9B%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2%E9%9D%9E%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E5%85%85%E7%94%B5%E6%A1%A9%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BF%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E6%96%B0%E6%9C%BA%E9%81%87/</link>
